{{!-- BULK LIKE (the Inbox's toolbar, Waiting tab; routes/inbox.js likeAllFor → POST /inbox/like-all): "♥ Like N"
      likes the N messages in this view still waiting for a like (every page, none newer than the page: `upTo`), as
      many as X allows right now (X: 50 likes every 15 minutes, 1,000 a day per user; extras.writesLeft). Over the
      whole view (no person or post picked, the same as the rail's Everyone) two deliberate clicks (public/js/
      confirm.js: "Click again to like N"; it used to ask in THE modal); in a person's or a post's view, one. When X's
      window is spent it's a disabled
      "♥ More at 3:42 PM" (the window's reset, in your time zone), so the limit is said, never discovered. It's LIVE:
      public/js/post-actions.js recounts N off THE OWED TABLE (partials/owed-model.hbs: what the view still owes a like,
      and X's window) as every ♥ moves it, and counts back up by itself when X's window ends; nothing owed hides it, an
      unlike brings it back. No tooltip on the button (tooltips are for explaining), the spent one neither (only an icon
      or something unclear gets one, and "More at 3:42 PM" says itself).
      Context: likeAll { n, owed, left, resetAt, q, person, post, upTo }, list.by. --}}
<span class="like-all" data-like-all>
{{#if likeAll}}{{#with likeAll}}
  <form id="like-all-form" method="post" action="/inbox/like-all" data-like-all-form{{#unless n}} hidden{{/unless}}>
    <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="{{@root.csrfToken}}">
    <input type="hidden" name="q" value="{{q}}">
    <input type="hidden" name="person" value="{{person}}">
    <input type="hidden" name="post" value="{{post}}">
    <input type="hidden" name="by" value="{{@root.list.by}}">
    <input type="hidden" name="upTo" value="{{upTo}}">
    <button type="submit" class="btn like-all-btn"{{#unless (or person post)}}{{#if (gt n 1)}} data-confirm="Click again to like {{n}}"{{/if}}{{/unless}}>{{> icon-heart}}<span>Like <span data-count="like-all-n">{{count n}}</span></span></button>
  </form>
  <span data-like-all-spent{{#if left}} hidden{{else}}{{#unless owed}} hidden{{/unless}}{{/if}}><button type="button" class="btn like-all-btn" disabled>{{> icon-heart}}<span>More <span data-like-all-at>{{#if resetAt}}at {{clock resetAt}}{{else}}tomorrow{{/if}}</span></span></button></span>
{{/with}}{{/if}}
</span>
